Larian Studios' templates
-------------------------

Mods/ProficiencyAtAGlance/GUI/Library/Lib_Keyboard.xaml replaces the game's own
file of that name. Besides the mod's own markup, it holds templates and styles
copied from the game's XAML, verbatim or with small changes that the comment
above each copy names. Those copies belong to Larian Studios and are distributed
under Larian's modding terms, not under the GPLv3.

From Public/Game/GUI/Library/DataTemplates.xaml:
- the game's inventory slot (its presenter, the presenter's style and three
  triggers), inside Template.InventorySlot
- BaseInvContainerItemStyle
- PaG.InvContainerItemTemplate (the template of BaseInvContainerItemStyle)
- InvContainerListBoxItemStyle

From Mods/MainUI/GUI/Pages/Trade.xaml:
- PaG.TradeItemTemplate (the template of the trade list's ListItemStyle)
- PaG.TradeItemStyle (the trade list's ListItemStyle)

From Public/Game/GUI/Library/CharacterSheetTemplates_k.xaml:
- PaG.InvContainerItemStyle (from InvContainerItemStyle)
- PaG.InvWorldContainerItemStyle (from InvWorldContainerItemStyle)
- PaG.SingleClickItemStyle (from SingleClickBaseInvContainerItemStyle)
- CharacterInventoryTemplate, PopOutInventoryTemplate, ContainerInventoryTemplate
  and PartyCharacterInventoryTemplate, each with its ItemContainerStyle pointed
  at the mod's copy
- PartyHolderStyle, unchanged, so that it uses the mod's
  PartyCharacterInventoryTemplate
- PaG.EquipmentSlotStyle (the game's equipment slot style, plus the mod's overlay)
- HelmetEQTemplate
- CharacterEquipmentTemplate

The badge masks (PaG.Mask.*) refer to the game's own icon art by path. The mod
includes none of that art.
